-- Conquest of Azeroth Barrens caravans (road-caravans-barrens): three Pack Kodo Caravan Carts based
-- at the Crossroads that run the Gold Road out and back. Generated by
-- .agents/plans/coa-world/tools/gen_caravans_barrens.py from the car3 route research
-- (research/caravans/route-barrens-taurajo.md, route-barrens-morshan.md, progress/car3-needles.md).
--
-- THE CARAVANS (DESIGN: the Crossroads to Camp Taurajo by Mulgore, to the Ashenvale blockade and to
--   Thousand Needles)
--   A 9006200 Crossroads <-> Camp Taurajo, driver 314860 Tauren Caravan Master.
--   B 9006201 Crossroads <-> the Mor'shan Rampart (the Horde gate on the Ashenvale border), driver
--     314858 Durotar Caravan Master.
--   C 9006202 Crossroads <-> the Great Lift of Thousand Needles, driver 314860 Tauren Caravan Master.
--
-- WHAT RIDES AND HOW
--   Migration 50 defines the cart 50470 (vehicle 1527, spell-click 46598 refused in combat), the
--   masters 314860/314873 and the invisible Caravan Harness 9303000; this file only references them.
--   Each spawn gets its own crew (vehicle_accessory, as migration 50 does for 9006004/9006005): the
--   master in the driver seat 1 and the harness in the empty draft seat 2, so riders always get the
--   passenger seats (6 per cart). Carts run at 14 yd/s (RUN), stop at each end facing the way they
--   leave, and turn back. Paths are points 1..N out and N-1..2 back, smoothTransition 1 (one spline
--   per leg).
--   A and C share the Gold Road from the Crossroads to the Taurajo junction. Left to 45-s stops they
--   would leave together and drive through each other; C is timed against A instead (section 3).
--
-- WHERE EACH VALUE COMES FROM
--   the three routes and their ends  DESIGN (the three caravans); the stops and every point
--     hand-traced on the CoA road texture by the car3 tracers, every z the server floor (DERIVED,
--     surface.py).
--   cart 50470 on these roads  ATLAS sighting (-877.06, -2540.08) on A/C's Gold Road (19 sightings,
--     Barrens and Durotar); drivers  ATLAS sightings of 314860 (south gate) and 314858 (north gate),
--     both 3.5 yd above the floor = vehicle 1527's driver seat; C's driver INFERRED.
--   314858 template  SOURCED-CACHE creaturecache (name, type, modifiers); the flags and faction copy
--     migration 50's 314873 (same name and role); display 4464 is a stand-in: its cached display
--     449159 (Kerak Ironhoof, Traveling Riding Trainer) does not resolve in the client (G3 gap).
--   speed 14 yd/s, a 100% mount (base run 7 x 2)  DESIGN
--     (as migration 50).
--   A/B's 45-s stops  INFERRED (as migration 50); C's stops and spawn point  DERIVED from the server
--     spline durations (research/caravans/car3-build/timing.py, car-speed/retime.py).
--
-- Id blocks: creature guid 9006200-9006299 (9006200-9006202 used), waypoint path
--   900620000-900629999 (guid x 100). Both lie outside migration 50's delete ranges
--   (9006000-9006199, 900600000-900619999). Entry 314858 is created here; no other scope writes it.
--   No stock row is changed.

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 1. Template: 314858 Durotar Caravan Master (driver of B; migration 50 does not create it)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Display 4464 (orc male, as 314873 and Kildar) stands in for the cached 449159, which does not resolve.
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `name` = VALUES(`name`), `subname` = VALUES(`subname`), `IconName` = VALUES(`IconName`), `minlevel` = VALUES(`minlevel`), `maxlevel` = VALUES(`maxlevel`), `exp` = VALUES(`exp`), `faction` = VALUES(`faction`), `npcflag` = VALUES(`npcflag`), `speed_walk` = VALUES(`speed_walk`), `speed_run` = VALUES(`speed_run`), `BaseAttackTime` = VALUES(`BaseAttackTime`), `RangeAttackTime` = VALUES(`RangeAttackTime`), `unit_class` = VALUES(`unit_class`), `unit_flags` = VALUES(`unit_flags`), `unit_flags2` = VALUES(`unit_flags2`), `type` = VALUES(`type`), `type_flags` = VALUES(`type_flags`), `VehicleId` = VALUES(`VehicleId`), `AIName` = VALUES(`AIName`), `MovementType` = VALUES(`MovementType`), `HealthModifier` = VALUES(`HealthModifier`), `ManaModifier` = VALUES(`ManaModifier`), `ArmorModifier` = VALUES(`ArmorModifier`), `RegenHealth` = VALUES(`RegenHealth`), `flags_extra` = VALUES(`flags_extra`), `ScriptName` = VALUES(`ScriptName`);

DELETE FROM `creature_template_model` WHERE `CreatureID` = 314858;

DELETE FROM `creature_template_addon` WHERE `entry` = 314858;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 2. Crew: the driver in seat 1 and the Caravan Harness in the empty draft seat 2, per spawn
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- A 9006200: driver 314860 Tauren Caravan Master: Tauren Caravan Master 314860 was seen seated 3.5 yd up (the
--   driver-seat height) outside the Crossroads south gate on this road (ATLAS), and cart 50470 was seen on this road
--   0.9 yd from the line (ATLAS); Camp Taurajo is the tauren camp by Mulgore (DESIGN).
-- B 9006201: driver 314858 Durotar Caravan Master: Durotar Caravan Master 314858 was seen seated 3.5 yd up in the
--   Crossroads north gate gap, the gate this road leaves by (ATLAS, 18 sightings); its cache modes are exactly those
--   of cart 50470 (CACHE).
-- C 9006202: driver 314860 Tauren Caravan Master: no sighting names this road's driver; the Tauren Caravan Master is
--   the one seen where this road leaves the Crossroads, and the road runs from Camp Taurajo to the tauren-built
--   Great Lift (INFERRED).
DELETE FROM `vehicle_accessory` WHERE `guid` IN (9006200, 9006201, 9006202);

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 3. Spawns: cart 50470 on its road, path guid x 100
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 9006200 A: Crossroads south gate, west shoulder (-594.0, -2640.5, 96.088) facing 3.53, waits 45 s <-> Camp Taurajo
--   east approach (-2318.0, -2029.0, 95.795) facing 4.758, waits 45 s; 190 road points, 2132 yd, path 900620000;
--   spawns at Crossroads south gate, west shoulder stop (-594.0, -2640.5, 96.088) facing 3.53, first target point 1.
--   45-s stops as in migration 50; one round trip is 394.906 s (two 152.453-s legs, server spline durations).
-- 9006201 B: Crossroads north gate (-326.0, -2682.0, 94.594) facing 6.245, waits 45 s <-> Mor'shan Rampart forecourt
--   (1226.0, -2250.3, 91.762) facing 3.927, waits 45 s; 148 road points, 1799 yd, path 900620100; spawns at
--   Crossroads north gate stop (-326.0, -2682.0, 94.594) facing 6.245, first target point 1. 45-s stops as in
--   migration 50; B shares no road with A or C.
-- 9006202 C: Crossroads south gate, east shoulder (-601.0, -2668.5, 95.976) facing 2.831, waits 75.052 s <-> Great
--   Lift (-4590.0, -1850.0, 86.111) facing 6.2, waits 75.052 s; 396 road points, 4474 yd, path 900620200; spawns at
--   road point 765 (-857.0, -2566.5, 91.672) facing 5.776, first target point 766. C runs on A's line for 1.95 km (A
--   nodes 5-173). Two 75.052-s stops make its round trip 789.812 s, exactly two of A's, so the two carts meet at the
--   same places every cycle; C spawns in A's grid (33,36), on its way back 20 s short of the Crossroads (road point
--   765 = node 27), so both appear together when the grid loads and C always follows A by 21 s northbound and 50 s
--   southbound. The rigs then stay 7.7 yd or more apart, and a drift of -20..+18 s is tolerated (timing.py). At the
--   Great Lift it faces 6.200, a definite 177-degree left turn through the open east side (the plain reverse 6.247
--   is a 180-degree tie).
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` IN (9006200, 9006201, 9006202);

DELETE FROM `creature_addon` WHERE `guid` IN (9006200, 9006201, 9006202);

